  "document": "Shareblue\nShareblue, formerly known as Blue Nation Review, is an American left-wing news website owned by the journalist and political activist David Brock. The website is headed by former Clinton staffer Peter Daou. Shareblue is within a consortium of political groups in Democratic strategist David Brock’s network that will raise a roughly $40 million budget to oppose President Donald Trump's policies."
